<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Hasted</ansi> mutation

Something in your legs shifts — tendons lengthen, muscles
redistribute. You cover ground with startling speed, though the
constant motion burns through your reserves.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Greatly increased movement speed — you travel between locations
  faster than nearly anyone

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately slower stamina recovery — the constant motion demands
  more from your body than it can quickly replenish

